## 5. Deployment Script Template (PowerShell)

Save this as `deploy-friend.ps1` in your project root:

```powershell
$SERVER = "root@158.220.100.58"
$APP_NAME = "my-fastapi-bot"
$LOCAL_PORT = "8003" # Port on server
$APP_PORT = "8000"   # Port inside Docker

Write-Host "--- Packaging $APP_NAME ---" -ForegroundColor Cyan
tar --exclude=venv --exclude=__pycache__ --exclude=.git -czvf "$APP_NAME.tar.gz" .

Write-Host "--- Uploading to Server ---" -ForegroundColor Cyan
scp "$APP_NAME.tar.gz" "${SERVER}:/root/$APP_NAME.tar.gz"

Write-Host "--- Deploying on Server ---" -ForegroundColor Cyan
$remoteCommand = "mkdir -p /root/$APP_NAME && cd /root/$APP_NAME && tar -xzvf /root/$APP_NAME.tar.gz && docker build -t $APP_NAME . && docker rm -f $APP_NAME 2>/dev/null; docker run -d -p ${LOCAL_PORT}:${APP_PORT} --name $APP_NAME --restart unless-stopped $APP_NAME"
ssh $SERVER $remoteCommand

Remove-Item "$APP_NAME.tar.gz"
Write-Host "✅ Deployment Complete!" -ForegroundColor Green
```
